  m_Name: memory_5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CozyFishing.Story.CutsceneDef
  id: memory_5
  titleEN: "Memory V \u2014 The Moon Eel"
  titleID: "Kenangan V \u2014 Belut Bulan"
  memory: 1
  music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3da5ac83c4bd77f4e80e1484990b8e80, type: 3}
  slides:
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 691faeac33bac1a4eb887272becd2f76, type: 3}
    textEN: Our last summer together. We sat on the dock and waited for the moon
      eel until you fell asleep on my arm.
    textID: Musim panas terakhir kita. Kita duduk di dermaga menunggu belut bulan
      sampai kamu tertidur di lenganku.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5ec544001e5cc5a4eb6e756c222e031c, type: 3}
    voiceID: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2952abad42bd0f14d9b4b84e3f169df0, type: 3}
    voiceM: {fileID: 0}
    voiceMID: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 5.5
    zoomFrom: 1.04
    zoomTo: 1.14
    panFrom: {x: 0, y: 0}
    panTo: {x: 0.02, y: -0.02}
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0795b9d5903f3954187858d9d6f7b8d5, type: 3}
    textEN: She came, trailing blue light under the water. I did not wake you. I
      wanted you to find her yourself, one day.
    textID: Ia datang, membawa cahaya biru di bawah air. Aku tak membangunkanmu.
      Aku ingin kamu menemukannya sendiri, suatu hari nanti.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2feaafe18a989c848914e510d1d8fbdb, type: 3}
    voiceID: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c4b94355b53738745887429f71340e0f, type: 3}
    voiceM: {fileID: 0}
    voiceMID: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 5.5
    zoomFrom: 1.04
    zoomTo: 1.14
    panFrom: {x: -0.02, y: 0.01}
    panTo: {x: 0.02, y: 0}
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 12b0d2fb0ad550547a493a38f9c201f8, type: 3}
    textEN: 'That night I wrote the last line in the journal: one day the river will
      need you. And you will be ready.'
    textID: 'Malam itu kutulis baris terakhir di jurnal: suatu hari sungai akan membutuhkanmu.
      Dan kamu akan siap.'
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fc79dabb6405b39448f9530c2068f2a0, type: 3}
    voiceID: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b65e58cc27f560e40825c502a03ea3ec, type: 3}
    voiceM: {fileID: 0}
    voiceMID: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 5.5
    zoomFrom: 1.04
    zoomTo: 1.14
    panFrom: {x: 0.02, y: -0.01}
    panTo: {x: -0.01, y: 0.02}
